<div class="brief-grid"><form id="free-form">
<section class="brief-card"><div class="section-label"><span>1</span><h2>Choose your product</h2></div><label for="product" class="form-label">Product from your catalog</label><select id="product" class="form-select"><option value="214">ProLab 65-inch 4K Interactive Smart Board</option></select><div class="product-preview mt-3"><img src="/storage/cms/media/ff01904c-455c-469a-a464-3a691446a615.webp" alt="Original ProLab 65-inch smart board catalog photograph"><div><span class="fact-tag">Original product · #214</span><h3>ProLab 65-inch 4K Interactive Smart Board</h3><p class="mb-0">65-inch 4K display · 20-point multi-touch</p></div></div><details class="mt-3"><summary class="field-note">Product facts &amp; exclusions</summary><p class="field-note mt-2">HDMI, USB touch, USB-A, Wi-Fi and Ethernet. Includes two touch pens and a wall-mount bracket. Computer, camera, microphone, mobile stand and installation are not included. The catalog photo shows a stand; creative must not imply it is included.</p></details><p class="field-note mt-3 mb-0">This sample includes one verified catalog product. Full catalog selection is not connected yet.</p></section>
<section class="brief-card"><div class="section-label"><span>2</span><h2>What kind of post?</h2></div><p class="field-note">Choose the content format. AI will create the composition, rather than fill a fixed layout.</p><div id="content-types" class="content-types" role="group" aria-label="Visual content type"></div><div id="carousel-options" class="tint-panel mt-3" hidden><label for="slide-count" class="form-label">How many slides?</label><select id="slide-count" class="form-select"><option value="3">3 slides · A quick story</option><option value="4">4 slides · Room for detail</option><option value="5">5 slides · A deeper look</option><option value="6">6 slides · The full picture</option></select><p class="field-note mt-2 mb-0">One coherent story: a hook, useful detail and a closing call to action. Each slide will have its own image.</p></div><div id="evidence-panel" class="tint-panel mt-3" hidden><label for="evidence" class="form-label" id="evidence-label">Confirmed source material</label><textarea id="evidence" class="form-control" rows="4" placeholder="Provide the real events or approved case facts. Omit customer contact details and private identifiers."></textarea><p id="evidence-note" class="field-note mt-2 mb-0"></p></div><p id="format-note" class="format-note mt-3 mb-0"></p></section>
<section class="brief-card"><div class="section-label"><span>3</span><h2>A visual direction, not a box</h2></div><p class="field-note">References guide mood, light and visual energy. AI is free to redesign the layout for your product and copy.</p><button id="open-references" type="button" class="btn-crm-secondary">Explore image references <i class="bi bi-images"></i></button><div id="selected-reference" class="selected-reference mt-3"></div><label for="creative-notes" class="form-label mt-3">Your creative direction <span class="text-muted fw-normal">Optional</span></label><textarea id="creative-notes" class="form-control" rows="3" placeholder="e.g. Make it feel like a premium technology campaign. Strong hook, natural light, no people."></textarea></section>
<section class="brief-card"><div class="section-label"><span>4</span><h2>Your brand stays recognisable</h2></div><div class="brand-preview"><img src="/storage/branding/37c7b60a-e7c1-4968-ac20-5695f5be70ba.png" alt="Original Pro Computer Centre logo"><div><strong>Pro Computer Centre</strong><p class="field-note mb-0">Original company name and Logo supplied as brand references.</p></div></div><div class="row g-3 mt-2"><div class="col-sm-6"><label for="theme-color" class="form-label">Theme colour</label><div class="color-field"><input id="theme-color" type="color" value="#123e5a"><span id="theme-hex">#123e5a</span></div><p class="field-note">Choose the brief’s colour; this sample has not read saved brand colours.</p></div><div class="col-sm-6"><label for="brand-name" class="form-label">Company name</label><input id="brand-name" class="form-control" value="Pro Computer Centre" readonly></div></div><p class="field-note mb-0">AI may compose the full image, but must preserve the real product and exact brand identity. Generated Logo accuracy still needs review; no guarantee of pixel-exact reproduction.</p></section>
<section class="brief-card"><div class="section-label"><span>5</span><h2>Make the image and words work together</h2></div><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-sm-6"><label for="goal" class="form-label">Marketing goal</label><select id="goal" class="form-select"><option>Introduce the product</option><option>Encourage enquiries</option><option>Start a conversation</option><option>Explain a useful idea</option></select></div><div class="col-sm-6"><label for="language" class="form-label">Language</label><select id="language" class="form-select"><option>English</option><option>中文</option><option>Bahasa Melayu</option></select></div><div class="col-sm-6"><label for="audience" class="form-label">Audience</label><input id="audience" class="form-control" placeholder="e.g. Small office teams and educators"></div><div class="col-sm-6"><label for="tone" class="form-label">Voice</label><select id="tone" class="form-select"><option>Professional &amp; approachable</option><option>Warm &amp; conversational</option><option>Bold &amp; playful</option></select></div></div><fieldset class="mt-4"><legend class="form-label">Platform versions</legend><div class="platform-choices"><label><input type="checkbox" name="platform" value="Facebook" checked><i class="bi bi-facebook"></i>Facebook</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="platform" value="Instagram" checked><i class="bi bi-instagram"></i>Instagram</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="platform" value="TikTok" checked><i class="bi bi-tiktok"></i>TikTok</label></div></fieldset><p class="field-note mt-3 mb-0">Platform-specific image and caption plans; actual account and publishing-format support must be checked before publishing.</p></section></form>
<aside class="brief-summary"><section class="brief-card"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR CREATIVE DIRECTION</span><h2 class="mt-3">Designed around your idea</h2><dl id="summary"></dl><div class="tint-panel"><strong>Image + post copy, one idea</strong><p class="mt-2 mb-0">The headline, imagery, caption and call to action will share one creative direction. No fixed canvas coordinates.</p></div><p id="validation-error" role="alert" class="text-danger small mt-3" hidden></p><button type="submit" form="free-form" class="btn-crm-primary w-100 mt-4 justify-content-center">Generate Post <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></button><p class="field-note text-center mt-3 mb-0">Preview only. No AI request, Credits charge, draft or publication.</p></section></aside></div>
<dialog id="references" aria-labelledby="references-title"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center gap-3"><div><span class="eyebrow">IMAGE REFERENCE LIBRARY</span><h2 id="references-title" class="h4 mt-2 mb-0">Choose a feeling. Keep the freedom.</h2></div><button id="close-references" type="button" class="btn-crm-secondary" aria-label="Close image references"><i class="bi bi-x-lg"></i></button></div><p class="field-note mt-3">AI-generated industry examples, with fictional brands and subjects. Use the visual direction only; do not copy their brand, product, text or claims.</p><div class="reference-toolbar"><div><label for="reference-industry" class="form-label">Industry</label><select id="reference-industry" class="form-select"><option>All industries</option></select></div><span id="reference-count" class="field-note"></span></div><div class="reference-gallery"><div id="reference-grid" class="reference-grid"></div><aside id="reference-preview" class="reference-preview" aria-live="polite"></aside></div><div class="d-flex justify-content-end gap-3 mt-4"><button id="cancel-references" type="button" class="btn-crm-secondary">Cancel</button><button id="confirm-reference" type="button" class="btn-crm-primary">Use this direction <i class="bi bi-check2"></i></button></div></dialog>
<dialog id="review" aria-labelledby="review-title"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center gap-3"><div><span class="eyebrow">CREATIVE HANDOFF</span><h2 id="review-title" class="h4 mt-2 mb-0">Your brief, ready to review</h2></div><button id="close-review" type="button" class="btn-crm-secondary" aria-label="Close brief review"><i class="bi bi-x-lg"></i></button></div><dl id="review-summary"></dl><h3 class="h6 mt-4">Image &amp; copy plan</h3><ol id="story-plan" class="story-plan"></ol><div class="tint-panel">No generation has run. GPT Image 2.5 access, cost review and the generation API are not connected in this sample. The existing pilot uses GPT Image 2; its settings remain unchanged.</div><div class="d-flex gap-3 mt-4 flex-wrap"><button id="keep-editing" type="button" class="btn-crm-secondary">Keep editing</button><button type="button" class="btn-crm-primary" disabled>Generation not connected</button></div><p class="field-note mt-3 mb-0">Brief settings stay in this browser tab only. No Canvas editor is used in this flow.</p></dialog>